{"title":"Beigeslate","slug":"Beigeslate","hero":{"file":"Beigeslate.webp","width":400,"height":400},"pageid":239,"revid":14301,"timestamp":"2024-08-12T21:13:30Z","lastEditor":"Z3SC","categories":["Stone","Ores"],"infobox":{"type":"Stone","fields":[{"label":"Stone","value":"$10/stud"},{"label":"Refined","value":"$12/stud"},{"label":"Forged","value":"$16/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"v1.0.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"14/01/2023"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"trivia","text":"Trivia"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p><b>Beigeslate</b> is one of the 6 nodes that can spawn around <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Finlay/\">Finlay Island</a>. These nodes can be found almost anywhere around the island and also can spawn on the smaller islands off the coast of Finlay Island. They don't spawn on the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater Island</a>. These nodes can spawn in various range of sizes.\n</p><p>Its raw variant uses a pre-2022 Slate Roblox material. Its refined variant uses a pre-2022 Concrete Roblox material. Its forged variant uses a pre-2022 Cobblestone material. All versions use the same Pine Cone color.\n</p><p>Putting Beigeslate through a refiner raises the sell price to $6 per stud. Putting that refined Beigeslate through a forge further increases the price to $8 per stud.\n</p>\n<h5 id=\"the-chart-below-displays-all-possible-ores-that-spawn-within-this-node\">The chart below displays all possible ores that spawn within this node.</h5>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Tin\">Tin</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Tin/\">Tin</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Pyrite1\">Pyrite1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pyrite/\">Pyrite</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Copper1\">Copper1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Copper/\">Copper</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Iron1\">Iron1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Iron/\">Iron</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Gold1\">Gold1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gold/\">Gold</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Mythril 1\">Mythril 1</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mythril/\">Mythril</a></td>\n<td>1/100 Chance Spawn\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Adurite\">Adurite</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Adurite/\">Adurite</a></td>\n<td>1/175 Chance Spawn\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"trivia\">Trivia</h2>\n<ul><li>Beigeslate is one of the first slates to be added in the public alpha release.</li></ul>"}
